      "value": "<bdi><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Gerard_de_Lairesse\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Gerard de Lairesse\"><span title=\"painter and engraver from the Northern Netherlands (1641-1711)\">Gerard de Lairesse</span></a></bdi>",
